## BD ↔ CRM (Aug 12 2026)

- Every BD prospect creates/links **CRM company** (`record_kind=company`) + **CRM contact** (`record_kind=contact`, `parent_company_id` → company)
- `bd_records.company_id` + `bd_records.contact_id` both FK → `crm_customers`
- Helper: `lib/bd/crm-link.ts` (`ensureBdCrmCompanyAndContact`); wired on create / update / stage move / discovery log / handoff
- Stage → CRM status: early=`Prospect`, mid=`Lead`, `client_won`=`Client` (never downgrade Client)
- Handoff projects still attach to **company** row only (`projects.client_id`)

